<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lab Session Expiring Soon</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .warning-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .urgency-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            top: -5px;
            right: -5px;
            background-color: #dc2626;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        .lab-name {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .time-remaining {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .countdown-timer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #b91c1c 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .countdown-number {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .countdown-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .action-buttons {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .primary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
        }
        .secondary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            border: 1px solid #3b82f6;
            color: #1e40af;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .checklist {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .checklist h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .checklist ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .checklist li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .action-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .primary-button, .secondary-button {
                width: 100%;
                margin: 5px 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🚀 {{companyName}}</div>
            <h1 class="title">⏰ Lab Session Expiring Soon</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

            <p>This is an important reminder that your lab session is scheduled to expire soon. Please take immediate action to save your progress.</p>

            <div class="warning-banner">
                <div class="urgency-indicator">URGENT</div>
                <div class="lab-name">{{labName}}</div>
                {{#if expiresAt}}
                <div class="time-remaining">Expires: {{formatDate expiresAt}} at {{formatTime expiresAt}}</div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            {{#if timeRemaining}}
            <div class="countdown-timer">
                <div class="countdown-number">{{timeRemaining}}</div>
                <div class="countdown-label">Time Remaining</div>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div class="action-buttons">
                {{#if canExtend}}
                <a href="{{extendUrl}}" class="primary-button">⏰ Extend Session</a>
                {{/if}}
                <a href="{{accessUrl}}" class="secondary-button">🚀 Continue Lab</a>
            </div>

            <div class="warning-box">
                <strong>⚠️ What happens when your session expires?</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your lab environment will be automatically terminated</li>
                    <li>All unsaved work and progress will be lost</li>
                    <li>You'll need to restart the lab from the beginning</li>
                    <li>Any files or configurations not saved will be deleted</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="checklist">
                <h3>📋 Before Your Session Expires:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ Save all your work and important files</li>
                    <li>✅ Download any results or outputs you need</li>
                    <li>✅ Complete any remaining lab tasks</li>
                    <li>✅ Submit your lab if required</li>
                    {{#if canExtend}}
                    <li>✅ Consider extending your session if you need more time</li>
                    {{/if}}
                </ul>
            </div>

            {{#if canExtend}}
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>💡 Need More Time?</strong><br>
                You can extend your lab session {{#if maxExtensions}}up to {{maxExtensions}} times{{/if}} to give yourself more time to complete the exercises and save your work.
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <p>Don't let your hard work go to waste! Take action now to preserve your progress.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Need help extending your session? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
